sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: A straight line commensurable with the side of a rational plus a medial area is itself also the side of a rational plus a medial area.
----
proof:

Let {AB} be the side of a rational plus a medial area, and let {CD} be commensurable with {AB}.

It is to be proved that {CD} is also the side of a rational plus a medial area.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="250" height="95" tabindex="0"></canvas>
